Third-party code
----------------

firmware/pcap04_stdfw.h embeds the PCAP04 standard DSP firmware (548 bytes)
and its default register configuration (52 bytes), extracted from the ScioSense
PCAP04 sample code at https://github.com/sciosense/pcap04-sample-code

